    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40670" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rēcŭla</span></b>  (also written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rēscŭla</span></b> ),
			ae, f.
		dim.
		res. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A small matter</i>, <i>a trifle</i>,
			Plaut. Fragm. ap. <i><span class="en">Prisc. p. 613</span></i> P.; in
				plur., <i><span class="en">App. M. 4, p.
